<title>THAILAND: Krung Thai Bank unaudited Q3 net up.</title>
<headline>Krung Thai Bank unaudited Q3 net up.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's Krung Thai Bank Plc said on Tuesday its unaudited net profit in the third quarter rose 13 percent to 2.87 billion baht.</p>
<p>Its earnings per share in the quarter rose 12.8 percent to 1.94 baht per share, the bank said in a filing to the Stock Exchange of Thailand.</p>
<p>Krung Thai Bank's accumulated profit for the first nine months was up 15.2 percent to 8.86 billion baht, it said, without giving more details.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
